{"chapter": "cotangent", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "08V7", "placeholders": {"STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:b529183265b73bef794bc75acc96967ddfb92fb2c6a122f84f673db7a9061fca", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nWith this remark out of the way we can state the main\nresult of this section.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:eb3633269c9585111cec3fcb2da4997822620c67d0436fce75f736a24525c661", "unit_id": "tag:08V7:prose-0003"}
{"chapter": "cotangent", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "08V7", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$$\nL_{X/\\Lambda} = \nL\\pi_!(Li^*\\Omega_{\\mathcal{O}/\\underline{\\Lambda}}) =\nL\\pi_!(i^*\\Omega_{\\mathcal{O}/\\underline{\\Lambda}}) =\nL\\pi_!(\\Omega_{\\mathcal{O}/\\underline{\\Lambda}}\n\\otimes_\\mathcal{O} \\underline{\\mathcal{O}}_X)\n$$", "MATH_0002": "$D(\\mathcal{O}_X)$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-cotangent-morphism-schemes}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:e4b1b46a74415d3db05d4f5dedd0f8c0a61cf9bafa7759f53b6bb7fe64f08b36", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:de70ae7bfc2f72e63c6e42b79939ffc2dc2e7cd4e3c1c97d2c07e4e1ef582a04", "source_text": "In the situation above there is a canonical isomorphism\n<MATH_0001>\nin <MATH_0002>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:3ff8aa77ea6eb41e055eca8c0275b84599c958b93b194aaa98891cf064955326", "unit_id": "tag:08T9:statement"}
{"chapter": "cotangent", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "08V7", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$(U \\to \\mathbf{A})$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{C}_{X/\\Lambda}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{O}$", "MATH_0004": "$\\Lambda$", "MATH_0005": "$\\Omega_{\\mathcal{O}/\\underline{\\Lambda}}$", "MATH_0006": "$\\mathcal{O}$", "MATH_0007": "$L\\pi_!(\\Omega_{\\mathcal{O}/\\underline{\\Lambda}}\n\\otimes_\\mathcal{O} \\underline{\\mathcal{O}}_X)$", "MATH_0008": "$$\nU \\mapsto\n\\left(\\Omega_{\\mathcal{O}/\\underline{\\Lambda}}\n\\otimes_\\mathcal{O} \\underline{\\mathcal{O}}_X\\right)(\\mathbf{A}_{\\bullet, U})\n=\n\\Omega_{P_{\\bullet, U}/\\Lambda} \\otimes_{P_{\\bullet, U}} \\mathcal{O}_X(U) =\nL_{\\mathcal{O}_X(U)/\\Lambda}\n$$", "MATH_0009": "$L\\pi_!(\\Omega_{\\mathcal{O}/\\underline{\\Lambda}}\n\\otimes_\\mathcal{O} \\underline{\\mathcal{O}}_X)$", "MATH_0010": "$\\underline{\\Lambda} \\to \\mathcal{O}_X$", "MATH_0011": "$X$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{remark-compute-L-pi-shriek}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{remark-compute-L-pi-shriek}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{remark-map-sections-over-U}", "REF_0004": "\\ref{lemma-scheme-over-ring}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\medskip", "STRUCT_0002": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:101512938e9e57adba96a6b8e1501d7caa3a6fa36af3c166931f92b210386cd9", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:57d3734a5b55666c95ff299ef1e7c976fb1a036ff5ece2675544f9ffa9c4d1d9", "source_text": "We first observe that for any object <MATH_0001> of\n<MATH_0002>\nthe value of the sheaf <MATH_0003> is a polynomial algebra over <MATH_0004>.\nHence <MATH_0005> is a flat <MATH_0006>-module\nand we conclude the second and third equalities of the statement of the\nlemma hold.\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\nBy Remark <REF_0001> the object\n<MATH_0007>\nis computed as the sheafification of the complex of presheaves\n<MATH_0008>\nusing notation as in Remark <REF_0002>.\nNow Remark <REF_0003> shows that\n<MATH_0009>\ncomputes the cotangent complex of the map of rings\n<MATH_0010> on <MATH_0011>.\nThis is what we want by Lemma <REF_0004>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:9bed440061cc351606921ada4eb9c04532fbf18ae47e3f066823cc558408c5e0", "unit_id": "tag:08T9:proof"}
